39	// Embed is the Qwen3-Embedding adapter: an api.EmbeddingBackend over the
40	// model cmd/embed drives.
41	//
42	// One mutex guards the run. The device path is not reentrant -- one set of
43	// arenas, one residual stream -- and on the GPU every request would serialise
44	// at the queue anyway (see Device). The CPU path is guarded by the same lock
45	// for the simpler reason that it is only there to be correct.
